rer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe cityguard has arrived.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer leaves south.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe cityguard leaves east.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe janitor has arrived.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9"
out hero "Market Square\n\r  You are standing on the market square, the famous Square of Midgaard.\n\rA large, peculiar looking statue is standing in the middle of the square.\n\rRoads lead in every direction, north to the temple square, south to the\n\rcommon square, east and westbound is the main street.\n\rA cityguard stands here.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe beastly fido has arrived.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe cityguard leaves east.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe beastly fido leaves west.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer has arrived.\n\rThe wanderer strides in.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe wanderer looks around.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 103mv> \xff\x